{
    "title": "Offleash\u2019d",
    "description": "The community-building app that makes \u2018finding your (pet) people\u2019 easy and fun!\r\nA social app to connect with your (pet) people! Offleadsh\u2019d where pet parents can easily find dates, and friends and build their (pet) community! \r\n\r\nOffleash\u2019d is the ultimate community-building app for pet parents to find their (pet) people. Whether you\u2019re looking for pet-friendly events, planning your next playdate, or seeking pet-loving singles. \r\n\r\nOffleash\u2019d makes finding and connecting with your (pet) people easy. \r\n\r\nKey Features: \r\n\r\nCreate Profiles: Set up a profile for you and your pets to start connecting. \r\nExplore (Pet) Communities: Explore existing pet communities or build your own! \r\nChoose Your Path: Choose between making new friends or romantic connections, you decide. \r\nDiscover Local Pet Events: Find local pet friend events, play dates, or meet-ups and fill your pet activity calendar weekly.\r\nJoin the Community: Explore pet-friendly groups and chat with fellow pet parents and enthusiasts to connect and share experiences.\r\nOffleash'd Passport: Connect with pet parents from all over the country.\r\nAdvanced AI Matching: Our algorithm ensures you find meaningful connections based on your shared interests and mutual pet connections. \r\n\r\nOur Mission\r\n\r\nTo Increase and enrich human connection by offering more opportunities for engagement\r\nwithout compromising time spent with our pets, building a diverse, inclusive pet-friendly community.  \r\n\r\nGet Started Today: \r\n\r\nCreate Your Profile: Set up profiles for you and your pet. \r\nExplore and Connect: Meet your (pet) people\u2026find a new friend or your next date.\r\nJoin Events: Discover your local pet friend's activities and build lasting memories. \r\n\r\nReady to create awesome memories with your (pet) people? Download Offleash\u2019d today and start connecting!",
    "descriptionHTML": "The community-building app that makes \u2018finding your (pet) people\u2019 easy and fun!<br>A social app to connect with your (pet) people! Offleadsh\u2019d where pet parents can easily find dates, and friends and build their (pet) community! <br><br>Offleash\u2019d is the ultimate community-building app for pet parents to find their (pet) people. Whether you\u2019re looking for pet-friendly events, planning your next playdate, or seeking pet-loving singles. <br><br>Offleash\u2019d makes finding and connecting with your (pet) people easy. <br><br>Key Features: <br><br>Create Profiles: Set up a profile for you and your pets to start connecting. <br>Explore (Pet) Communities: Explore existing pet communities or build your own! <br>Choose Your Path: Choose between making new friends or romantic connections, you decide. <br>Discover Local Pet Events: Find local pet friend events, play dates, or meet-ups and fill your pet activity calendar weekly.<br>Join the Community: Explore pet-friendly groups and chat with fellow pet parents and enthusiasts to connect and share experiences.<br>Offleash&#39;d Passport: Connect with pet parents from all over the country.<br>Advanced AI Matching: Our algorithm ensures you find meaningful connections based on your shared interests and mutual pet connections. <br><br>Our Mission<br><br>To Increase and enrich human connection by offering more opportunities for engagement<br>without compromising time spent with our pets, building a diverse, inclusive pet-friendly community.  <br><br>Get Started Today: <br><br>Create Your Profile: Set up profiles for you and your pet. <br>Explore and Connect: Meet your (pet) people\u2026find a new friend or your next date.<br>Join Events: Discover your local pet friend&#39;s activities and build lasting memories. <br><br>Ready to create awesome memories with your (pet) people? Download Offleash\u2019d today and start connecting!",
